  "description": "Gold Wildwest is a bold Western display font designed to bring a rugged, vintage, and adventurous character to your creative projects. With its heavy letterforms and distinctive Wild West personality, this typeface is perfect for designs that need a strong, authentic Western presence.\nInspired by classic Rodeo, Ranch, Cowboy, Frontier, Western Americana, and vintage advertising aesthetics, Gold Wildwest works especially well for eye-catching headlines, logos, posters, apparel graphics, packaging, labels, badges, signage, and editorial designs.\nGive your next project a rugged frontier feel with Gold Wildwest, a powerful display typeface made for designs that need to stand out.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Gold Wildwest is a bold Western display font designed to bring a rugged, vintage, and adventurous character to your creative projects. With its heavy letterforms and distinctive Wild West personality, this typeface is perfect for designs that need a strong, authentic Western presence.</p>\n<p>Inspired by classic Rodeo, Ranch, Cowboy, Frontier, Western Americana, and vintage advertising aesthetics, Gold Wildwest works especially well for eye-catching headlines, logos, posters, apparel graphics, packaging, labels, badges, signage, and editorial designs.</p>\n<p>Give your next project a rugged frontier feel with Gold Wildwest, a powerful display typeface made for designs that need to stand out.</p>",
